@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080/api

### C1. Create a zero-balance party
# @name p
POST {{base}}/parties
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "P6 Step1 Party" }

### C2. Delete it
DELETE {{base}}/parties/{{p.response.body.id}}

### C3. Active list: must NOT contain it
GET {{base}}/parties

### C4. Deleted list: must contain it, "deleted": true
GET {{base}}/parties?deleted=true

### C5. Bad parameter
GET {{base}}/parties?deleted=maybe

### C6. Same for suppliers
# @name s
POST {{base}}/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "P6 Step1 Supplier" }

###
DELETE {{base}}/suppliers/{{s.response.body.id}}

###
GET {{base}}/suppliers?deleted=true